  HSAAI is a private, sovereign, self-hosted Enterprise AI Platform for
  Enterprise RAG, local LLM inference, AI agents, multi-agent orchestration,
  AI governance, LLMOps, MLOps, observability, DevSecOps, and
  Kubernetes-oriented deployment.

